{title: 265 - Breathe on Me, Breath of God}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #265 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 265}
{meta: category Holy Spirit - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Breathe on me, [Dbdim]breath [Db]of God,
[Gb]Fill [Ab7]me[Db]with [Eb7]life a[Ab]new,
[Ab]That I may [Ab7]love [Gb]what [Ab7]Thou [Adim7]dost[Bbm]love,
[Bbm7]And[Ebm7]do what [Fm]Thou [Ab7]wouldst [Db]do.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Db]Breathe on [Dbdim]me, breath [Db]of God,
[Gb]Until [Ab7]my [Db]heart [Eb7]is [Ab]pure,
[Ab]Until [Ab7]with [Gb]Thee [Ab7]I [Adim7]will [Bbm]one will,
[Bbm7]To [Ebm7]do [Fm]and [Ab7]to [Db]endure.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Db]Breathe on [Dbdim]me, breath [Db]of God,
[Gb]Till [Ab7]I [Db]am [Eb7]wholly [Ab]Thine,
[Ab]Until [Ab7]this [Gb]earthly [Ab7]part [Adim7]of [Bbm]me
[Bbm7]Glows [Ebm7]with [Fm]Thy [Ab7]fire [Db]divine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Db]Breathe on [Dbdim]me, breath [Db]of God,
[Gb]So [Ab7]shall [Db]I [Eb7]constant [Ab]be,
[Ab]And [Ab7]live [Gb]with [Ab7]Thee [Adim7]the [Bbm]perfect life
[Bbm7][Ebm7]Of [Fm][Ab7]Thine [Db]eternity.
{end_of_verse}
